// The steam borer bores a tunnel. A borer is set down in a dry chamber facing a granite face: it runs on coal alone.
// The mole puts two lumps of coal into its firebox (coal in paw, right mouse), gets on (empty paw) and drives
// right: the borer raises steam, and grinds into the granite a column at a time; every
// cell it cuts comes out behind it, along its spoil belt, as loose gravel in the chamber (as much as it cut), and it
// moves on into the hole. Space gets off; the borer is saved.
map
########################################
########################################
########################################
########################################
########################################
########################################
#............###########################
#............###########################
#............###########################
#............###########################
#..@.........###########################
########################################
########################################
########################################
end
give SteamBorer 1
give Coal 3
hold 1-1 right                        // face right: the borer's head faces the way the mole does
place 2 5 0 SteamBorer
expect 3 borers == 1
wield 10 Coal
use 11 5 -1                           // two lumps into its firebox
use 12 5 -1
wield 13 none
use 14 5 -1                           // get on
expect 15 onborer == 1
expect 15 borerfuel == 2
expect 15 inv:Coal == 1
expect 200 borersteam > 5             // steam up
hold 300-1800 right                   // drive into the face
expect 1800 borerx > 12               // bored into the granite (its front was at the face at 10)
expect 1800 static:Granite <= 490     // the rock it cut...
expect 1800 cells:Gravel,-3,12,-5,0 >= 10 // ...came out behind it as gravel
expect 1800 log:jammed == 0
hold 1805-1807 jump                   // Space: off
expect 1810 onborer == 0
saveload 1812
expect 1813 borers == 1
expect 1813 borerx > 12
